and the farwell deal. Please review and let me know if you agree with this.
If you agree, we will unwind/kill the TRAX deals and book the spreadsheet
amounts. We are still working on the spread option and foreign exchange
being included in this model. For the foreign exchange, I took an average
exchange rate for the life of each deal for now. Thanks.

Helena

